chat" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Verdana;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➏&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="685" width="48" height="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hermes-46" edge="1" parent="hermes-chat" source="hermes-36" target="hermes-39" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;curved=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontFamily=Verdana;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="hermes-47" edge="1" parent="hermes-chat" source="hermes-4" target="hermes-39" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;curved=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontFamily=Verdana;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1700" y="330" /><mxPoint x="1700" y="150" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="hermes-48" edge="1" parent="hermes-chat" source="hermes-4" target="hermes-42" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;curved=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontFamily=Verdana;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="hermes-49" edge="1" parent="hermes-chat" source="hermes-44" target="hermes-5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;curved=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontFamily=Verdana;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1180" y="750" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="hermes-50" parent="hermes-info" style="text;html=1;spacing=20;spacingTop=-30;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#7EA6E0;strokeColor=none;arcSize=4;glass=0;shadow=0;opacity=25;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height: 120%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Hermes Agent Flow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 120%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;A &lt;b&gt;Hermes Agent&lt;/b&gt; (Nous Research) running on a single &lt;b&gt;Lightsail instance&lt;/b&gt;, reachable from &lt;b&gt;Telegram&lt;/b&gt; and from &lt;b&gt;Hermes Desktop&lt;/b&gt;. The model is &lt;b&gt;Claude Haiku on Amazon Bedrock&lt;/b&gt;; there is no third-party API key. It is one stack, &lt;b&gt;hermes-agents-infrastructure&lt;/b&gt;, plus an app release uploaded over SSH. Each stage (dev, test, prod) lives in its own AWS account, so names carry no stage. It has no database and nothing is published except SSH.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deploy.&lt;/b&gt; A developer &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➊&lt;/font&gt; works inside the &lt;b&gt;dev container&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➋&lt;/font&gt;. &lt;b&gt;deploy-infra&lt;/b&gt; runs the Serverless Framework: it uploads the template to the &lt;b&gt;deployment bucket&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➍&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;b&gt;CloudFormation&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➌&lt;/font&gt; creates the &lt;b&gt;Lightsail instance&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➎&lt;/font&gt; with its static IP, a firewall that only allows SSH, and a daily snapshot. Docker is installed on the first boot. The stack also creates the &lt;b&gt;Parameter Store&lt;/b&gt; entries &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➏&lt;/font&gt; that hold the instance name and public IP, a &lt;b&gt;Secrets Manager&lt;/b&gt; secret &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➐&lt;/font&gt; and an &lt;b&gt;IAM user&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➑&lt;/font&gt; allowed only to invoke the chosen Bedrock model; its access key is stored in the secret.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;deploy-app&lt;/b&gt; finds the server in &lt;b&gt;Parameter Store&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➏&lt;/font&gt;, reads the Bedrock key from &lt;b&gt;Secrets Manager&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(103, 171, 159);&quot;&gt;➐&lt;/font&gt;, renders a private environment file from the developer's configuration (the Telegram token never goes through CloudFormation) and uploads a release over SSH. Docker Compose builds and starts the two containers, keeps the last three releases, and the local environment file is deleted afterwards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Chat.&lt;/b&gt; An allowed user &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➊&lt;/font&gt; writes to the bot on &lt;b&gt;Telegram&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➋&lt;/font&gt;. The &lt;b&gt;gateway&lt;/b&gt; container &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➌&lt;/font&gt; only makes outbound connections (long polling), so no port is opened, and ignores anyone who is not in the allowlist, because the agent has a shell. It calls &lt;b&gt;Claude Haiku on Bedrock&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➍&lt;/font&gt; with the IAM user's key. Sessions, memory, configuration and the skills the agent creates live in the &lt;b&gt;data volume&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➐&lt;/font&gt;, which survives releases; the skills versioned in the repository are mounted read-only next to it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hermes Desktop.&lt;/b&gt; The &lt;b&gt;dashboard&lt;/b&gt; container &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➎&lt;/font&gt; listens only on the instance's loopback. &lt;b&gt;Hermes Desktop&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;➏&lt;/font&gt; reaches it through an SSH tunnel opened by the developer and authenticates with the session token the dashboard creates each time it starts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2330" y="40" width="720" height="540" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>
